<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Constaffel</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">from <a href="/years/1336">1336</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/14th-century">14th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Constaffel was the corporation of the nobility, knights, rentiers and leading merchants of Zürich, created by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rudolf-brun">Rudolf Brun</a>'s constitution of 1336 alongside the craft <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guild">guilds</a>. It sent members to the city's Small and Large Councils and was the political home of the old patrician families. It survives today as a social society that takes part in the Sechseläuten festival.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/constaffel.jpg" alt="Constaffel" width="320" height="375" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CHE_Gesellschaft_zur_Constaffel_COA.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
